# MINDMAP does not use a GitHub token.
# Ingest calls `gh api` with your existing CLI login (read-only usage).
#
# Required for `make refresh` (local ledger path):
#   export MINDMAP_LEDGER=/absolute/path/to/build/task-ledger.md
#
# Or use the mirrored ledger (MM-010) with no MINDMAP_LEDGER:
#   make refresh-gh-ledger
#   # → gh api repos/ManpreetS2/agent-mindmap/contents/ledger.md?ref=data/ledger
#
# Do NOT put GITHUB_TOKEN or PATs here. Do not commit a real .env.
